flowchart TB
    Q[job grid: instance x config x seed, rounds 0..5] --> W1[worker 1]
    Q --> W2[worker 2]
    Q --> Wn[worker 15]
    W1 --> V[verify in worker]
    W2 --> V
    Wn --> V
    V -- feasible --> M{better than best?}
    M -- yes --> B[atomic write to best/]
    M -- within 5% --> C[candidates/]
    V --> J[jobs.jsonl]
    B --> L[leaderboard.csv]
